---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title='Partners | OTA World'
  description='OTA World partnership: no franchise fee, no royalty. Inventory, training, delivery, and service from Carrollton.'
>
<main id="main">
    <section class="chapter-hero">
      <img src="/assets/images/home-grid-2.jpg" alt="OTA World partner showroom" />
      <div class="chapter-hero-veil"></div>
      <div class="container chapter-hero-copy">
        <div class="kicker">America’s No. 1</div>
        <h1>Put the leading name<br />on your door.</h1>
        <p class="lede">No franchise fee. No royalty. Partner with America’s No. 1 house of massage chairs.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">Who this is for</div>
          <h2>A showroom of America’s No. 1.</h2>
          <p class="intro">Made for operators who already know how to welcome a guest — and would rather sell the leading house than carry inventory, trucks, and warranty alone.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="support-grid">
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>What you do</h3>
            <p>Receive the guest. Let them sit. Complete the sale. The floor is your work.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>What we do</h3>
            <p>Training, delivery, installation, warranty, and after-service from Carrollton. The house behind every chair.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="support-item">
            <h3>What you put in</h3>
            <p>Showroom inventory, about $40,000 to $120,000, planned with headquarters. We walk the numbers in consultation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section bg-warm">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">The path</div>
          <h2>Four conversations. Then a door.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <article>
            <b>01</b>
            <p>Inquire. A call or a note to headquarters — city, space, and intent.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <b>02</b>
            <p>Consult. We walk inventory, floor size, and what the house will carry.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <b>03</b>
            <p>Stock. Chairs arrive. Training happens. You are not left to invent the floor.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <b>04</b>
            <p>Open. You show. We deliver, install, and stand behind — for as long as the chair is in the home.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div class="kicker">Investment</div>
          <h2>At a glance</h2>
          <p class="intro">Figures follow the current site as a first draft. Confirm headquarters materials before any agreement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Item</th>
                <th>OTA HealthMate</th>
                <th>PLUS</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Franchise fee</td>
                <td>None</td>
                <td>None</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Royalty</td>
                <td>None</td>
                <td>None</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Showroom inventory</td>
                <td>$40,000 – $65,000</td>
                <td>$65,000 – $120,000</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Headquarters support</td>
                <td colspan="2">Training · delivery · installation · service · warranty</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="notice" style="margin-top:16px">This table is a website prototype summary. Lease, build-out, insurance, and other on-site costs vary by location.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:28px">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact?topic=franchise">Request partner information</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="tel:+18888482630">888-848-2630</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
